abstract: >-
  Publicly accessible, reconstructed research reference for a dual-path
  privacy-preserving chemical trace sensing architecture. Includes a
  synthetic-data aggregation demonstrator, privacy limitations, and
  proposed hardware and post-quantum migration plans. Not certified or
  field-deployable.
